@startuml
!theme materia
title RfC Status Update Flow (async callback) — POST /status-update-cancel
participant "**EPC SP**\n(Payer's SRTP-SP)" as EPC
participant "**MS-SENDER**\n(rtp-sender-v2)" as SENDER
database "**Service Registry**\n(Azure Blob Storage)" as SR
database "**RTPS**\n(MongoDB)" as MONGO
database "**Azure Data Explorer**\n(SRTP)" as ADX
autonumber "<b>[0]"

note over EPC, SENDER
  Callback sent by the Payer's SRTP-SP when the sync
  **POST /rtps/status-update/cancel** got **200 without reason** (outcome deferred)
end note

EPC -> SENDER: **POST** /status-update-cancel \n(header: X-Client-Certificate-Serial,\nbody: RfC status update response — DS-16 RFC)
activate SENDER

alt **Payload readable (Debtor SP id present in Assgnmt.Assgne)**

  SENDER -> SR: retrieve Debtor SP data
  activate SR

  alt **SP Found**
    SR --> SENDER: SP data
    deactivate SR

    alt **Certificate serial matches the registry**

      SENDER -> MONGO: find Rtp by resourceId (original message id)
      activate MONGO

      alt **RTP Found**
        MONGO --> SENDER: Rtp
        deactivate MONGO

        alt **[200 OK] Success Cases**
          alt **[SUCCESS — FINAL] reason AEXR / RCAR**
            note right of SENDER
              AEXR → **EXPIRED** (from SENT | ACCEPTED | RFC_SENT)
              RCAR → **CANCELLED_REJECTED** (from RFC_SENT | CANCELLED)
            end note

            loop **retry on error (exhausted → error propagated)**
              SENDER -> ADX: save RTP record (final **state**) + RTP events
              activate ADX
              ADX --> SENDER: confirm
              deactivate ADX
            end

            loop **retry on error (exhausted → error propagated)**
              SENDER -> MONGO: delete RTP record
              activate MONGO
              MONGO --> SENDER: confirm delete
              deactivate MONGO
            end

          else **[SUCCESS — RFC NOT RECEIVED] reason RCNR**
            SENDER -> MONGO: update Rtp: add **RFC_NOT_RECEIVED** event
            activate MONGO
            MONGO --> SENDER: updated
            deactivate MONGO
            note right of SENDER: RFC_SENT → RFC_SENT (state unchanged, event recorded)

          else **[NO TRANSITION] reason RCPR**
            note right of SENDER: RfC already received and processed:\nstate unchanged, nothing written to the DB

          else **[ALREADY APPLIED] RTP already in the state implied by AEXR / RCAR**
            note right of SENDER: idempotent no-op, nothing written to the DB
          end

          SENDER --> EPC: **200 OK** (empty body)
          note right of SENDER
            **200 OK Cases:**
            - Reason AEXR / RCAR (Final states saved to ADX & deleted from MONGO)
            - Reason RCNR (RFC_NOT_RECEIVED event recorded, state stays RFC_SENT)
            - Reason RCPR (No transition)
            - Already applied (Idempotent no-op)
          end note

        else **[400 Bad Request] Callback Content Error Cases**
          note right of SENDER
            **400 Cases:**
            - Invalid status transition from current state
              (e.g. RCNR on an RTP not in RFC_SENT)
            - Unknown reason code
            - Missing reason code
          end note
          SENDER --[#red]> EPC: **400 Bad Request** (empty body)

        else **[500 Internal Server Error] Persistence failure**
          note right of SENDER
            **500 Cases:**
            - MongoDB update / delete failed after retries
            - ADX save failed after retries
          end note
          SENDER --[#red]> EPC: **500 Internal Server Error**
        end

      else **[RTP NOT FOUND] RTP not in DB**
        MONGO --[#red]> SENDER: empty
        deactivate MONGO
        SENDER --[#red]> EPC: **400 Bad Request** (empty body)
        note right of SENDER: Unknown resourceId, or RTP already finalized & deleted
      end

    else **[FORBIDDEN] Certificate serial mismatch**
      SENDER --[#red]> EPC: **403 Forbidden** (empty body)
    end

  else **[SP NOT FOUND] Debtor SP not in registry**
    SR --[#red]> SENDER: not found
    deactivate SR
    SENDER --[#red]> EPC: **400 Bad Request** (empty body)
  end

else **[INVALID REQUEST] Empty body / missing Debtor SP id / missing original message id**
  SENDER --[#red]> EPC: **400 Bad Request** (empty body)
  deactivate SENDER
end
@enduml
